{"id":"L-meta-1507","title":"Probe: every monotone fan-in-two AND/OR formula for the edge function of the Petersen graph has depth at least 5","formal_statement":"¬ (∀ T : ℕ → Set ((Fin 10 → Bool) → Bool), (∀ i : Fin 10, (fun x : Fin 10 → Bool => x i) ∈ T 0) → (∀ (k : ℕ) (f : (Fin 10 → Bool) → Bool), f ∈ T k → f ∈ T (k + 1)) → (∀ (k : ℕ) (f g : (Fin 10 → Bool) → Bool), f ∈ T k → g ∈ T k → (fun y : Fin 10 → Bool => f y && g y) ∈ T (k + 1) ∧ (fun y : Fin 10 → Bool => f y || g y) ∈ T (k + 1)) → (fun z : Fin 10 → Bool => (z 0 && z 1) || (z 1 && z 2) || (z 2 && z 3) || (z 3 && z 4) || (z 4 && z 0) || (z 0 && z 5) || (z 1 && z 6) || (z 2 && z 7) || (z 3 && z 8) || (z 4 && z 9) || (z 5 && z 7) || (z 7 && z 9) || (z 9 && z 6) || (z 6 && z 8) || (z 8 && z 5)) ∈ T 4)","statement_hash":"sha256:bcfc1a1f407e8235ec468575db9ffb4b441e557948929b377b8e37f6ac6b061e","plain_statement":"For the Petersen graph on inputs 0..9 (outer cycle 0-1-2-3-4-0, spokes i to i + 5, inner pentagram 5-7-9-6-8-5), the function true exactly when both ends of some edge are true has no monotone formula of depth at most 4. A monotone formula: a tree of fan-in-two AND and OR gates over the inputs, no NOT, no constants; depth at most d is said as: the function lies in level d of every family of sets of functions that holds the inputs at level 0, keeps each level in the next, and puts the AND and the OR of two level-k functions in level k + 1. Conjecture.","status":"checked","barrier":null,"depends_on":[],"program":"meta_complexity","seat":"seat-intake-1","proposed_at":"2026-11-24T00:37:35.790Z","attempts":[{"when":"2026-11-24T01:05:25.589Z","ended_at":"2026-11-24T01:05:25.589Z","by":"seat-intake-1","outcome":"checked","funded_by":{"kind":"baseline","name":"Brilliant"}}],"artifact":{"lean_file":"lean/PEqualNP/Outside/L_meta_1507.lean","checker_version":"outside-runner","checker_run_id":"run-028453","content_hash":"sha256:a5d95dd4b494a88dffb2f51d4d5273e057e5bd1ef1278b6ce05f536efb625e8f","runner_url":"https://github.com/brilliant-hq/pequalnp-proofs/actions/runs/45301521147"},"contributor":{"github":"odinfree","pr_url":"https://github.com/brilliant-hq/pequalnp-proofs/pull/3041","merged_at":"2026-11-24T01:05:25.589Z"},"kind":"helper","result":{"contributor":{"id":"seat-intake-1","display_name":"seat-intake-1","kind":"fleet"},"funded_by":{"kind":"baseline","name":"Brilliant"}},"used_by":[],"status_at":"2026-11-24T01:05:25.589Z","layer":0}